# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets redirect rules.
#
# Production replacement for `redirects()` in next.config.mjs, which a static export
# cannot run. Copied into `out/` by the build; evaluated by the asset router before any
# asset lookup, so these cost no Worker invocation.
#
# 308, not 301: 301 lets an agent downgrade a POST to GET on replay. Nothing POSTs to
# these paths today, but 308 is the permanent redirect that preserves method, and it is
# what `permanent: true` emitted before the migration — keeping the status identical
# means no already-indexed URL changes its meaning.
#
# Canonicalises the mockup's /plans routes onto /esim/:slug (blueprint §28.3). Mirrored
# in next.config.mjs for `next dev`; change both together.

/plans                  /destinations   308
/plans/:slug            /esim/:slug     308
/destinations/:slug     /esim/:slug     308
